# Pipelines a draw may wait for (dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m): a blended effect draw whose pipeline is not built yet waits for it off the frame instead of
# stalling the frame; every other miss is compiled in the frame. No warm-up list here (DM_PSO_MANIFEST=off), so every pipeline of the camp and of the
# walk into the Blood Moor is met for the first time, and each off-frame build is slowed by 200 ms so that draws do wait: some builds must have landed,
# and nothing may be red.
name pso_wait
requires cli
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896 DM_PSO_MANIFEST=off DM_PSO_USER=off DM_PSO_ASYNC_TEST_MS=200
timeout 240

enter_game
sleep 4
walk_to 5789 4470 timeout=20
walk_to 5789 4495 timeout=20
walk_to 5791 4523 timeout=25
expect_state area=2 timeout=10
walk_to 5791 4560 timeout=25
sleep 4
quit
check log_has re="pipeline built off the frame in [0-9.]+ ms: .*; [1-9][0-9]* draws waited"
check no_red
